{
  "id": "day-revision-heldout-final-v1",
  "split": "heldout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "unseen-draft-edit-delay-apply-cancel",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "今晚挤不出太多时间，连热身在内十八分钟封顶。晚饭想要160克豆腐配170克米饭；把今天练和晚饭统筹成一份待选方案，午餐不要动。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "scope": [
              "workout",
              "dinner"
            ],
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "food": {
              "豆腐": 160,
              "米饭": 170
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "练的那部分照这份，主食的量也锁住。把豆腐改成220克虾，还是只改草案，不要落地。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "same_draft": true,
            "keep_workout": true,
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "food": {
              "虾": 220,
              "米饭": 170
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先等一下，不要应用，保留现在的方案让我再看一眼。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "same_draft": true,
            "keep_workout": true,
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "food": {
              "虾": 220,
              "米饭": 170
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这版我核对好了，可以按它更新今天的安排了。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "same_draft": true,
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "apply": true,
            "food": {
              "虾": 220,
              "米饭": 170
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "现在只另做个晚饭备选：鸡胸肉200克、米饭150克。训练沿用已经保存的，不包含在这次修改里。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "scope": [
              "dinner"
            ],
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "food": {
              "鸡胸肉": 200,
              "米饭": 150
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不要这个备选了，撤掉它，刚保存的虾那份留着。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "cancelled",
              "rejected",
              "success"
            ],
            "draft_status": "cancelled"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "把今天已经生效的训练安排再读给我，只读，不改。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "draft_status": "cancelled"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unseen-rolled-back-progress",
      "fixture": "rollback",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我刚把长期版本退回去了。现在每个正式动作到底要几组，已经记了多少，还欠几组？以退回后的安排为准。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "reply_contains": [
              "3 组",
              "还差 1 组"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "刚才这些记录先别动，再核对一次今天的目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "reply_contains": [
              "3 组",
              "还差 1 组"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}